  "id": "jpeg-byte-mode-replay",
  "title": "JPEG byte histograms: the four-page split",
  "status": "published",
  "question": "Does the reported four-page JPEG byte-frequency class reproduce, and does it correspond to grayscale encoding?",
  "summary": "The LP2 four-page modal-byte split reproduces. Both classes include one- and three-component JPEGs, so the simple grayscale explanation does not fit the archived files.",
