    "representation": "All 58 archived LP2 and 17 archived LP1 original JPEG files; full encoded-file bytes, not pixels or rune values.",
    "procedure": "Count all 256 possible byte values in each file; read baseline JPEG frame component counts; locate zero bytes relative to the first scan header.",
    "parameters": "A file's class is determined only by its modal whole-byte value; ties are reported explicitly; no threshold or page exclusion.",
