  "outcome": "supported",
  "finding": "LP2-00, 04, 24 and 26 have modal byte 44; the other 54 LP2 files have modal byte 00. Both classes include one- and three-component JPEGs. LP1-00 and 02 have modal byte 28; the other 15 LP1 files have modal byte 00.",
  "limitations": "The test uses current archived JPEGs; the source's exact October 2023 repository revision and missing histogram screenshots are unavailable. File-byte mode does not establish randomness, a payload, a date code or an encoding cause.",
  "next_steps": "For a causal encoding claim, freeze a decoder or re-encoding procedure and controls before testing it on all archived page files.",
